        },
        {
          "insert": " to record speech and inspect progress, transcripts, and vocabulary hints in history. When you change helper lifecycle behavior, also verify cancellation and a following recording in the app. The "
        },
        {
          "insert": "Development",
          "attributes": {
            "reference": {
              "kind": "doc",
              "path": "40-guides/40-development"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " guide has the setup. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "AGENTS.md",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
